      /*
        `pointer-events-none` on the full-width wrapper, `pointer-events-auto` on
        the card. This wrapper spans the entire bottom of the viewport while the
        card it draws is only `max-w-3xl` and centred — so at 1440px it was
        swallowing clicks across empty space in both bottom corners, including the
